date-released: 2025-02-14
abstract: >-
  PVmesh is an open-source Python tool for generating high-fidelity, adaptive
  finite-element meshes for photovoltaic modules. It supports multilayer panel
  geometries, frame details, and mounting zones that are often difficult to
  mesh robustly with generic workflows. Built on Gmsh, PVmesh automates geometry
  construction, partitioning, domain/boundary tagging, and export for downstream
  finite-element solvers.
